ocdn.com/uploads/day_260417/202604170410316556_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马在欧冠1/4决赛被拜仁淘汰，卡马文加次回合最后时刻的染红无疑是皇马出局的主要原因之一。赛后，卡马文加在社媒致歉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-17/69e12a3f8387fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真不冤！裁判向卡马文加出牌时比了个“2”，示意他已两次拖延</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260417/202604170228205707.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260417/202604170228205707.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260417/202604170228205707.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠1/4决赛次回合，拜仁vs皇马，在卡马文加领到第二张黄牌时，裁判比了个“2”，示意他已两次拖延。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-17/69e117df5de87native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击第五冠！埃梅里率队晋级欧联4强，此前四夺欧联冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.38" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.38" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.38" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260222/6999df1d7cf84.